c="/assets-f/img/8d6f4453624a46.svg" alt="Georgian Farmers" width="140" height="140" style="height: auto;"> </div> <div class="item"> <img data-no-lazy="1" loading="eager" src="/assets-f/img/9d47dd233edea9.svg" alt="AgroXchange" width="140" height="140" style="height: auto;"> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-lg-7 offset-lg-0 order-1 order-lg-2 mb-7 mb-md-9 mb-lg-0"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/65c71144f209c2.webp" media="(max-width: 420px)" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/65c71144f209c2.webp" media="(max-width: 991px)" type="image/webp"><img src="/assets-f/img/3cb2313f6d7b26.png" alt="EOS Data Analytics transforms raw satellite imagery into clear data providing advanced Earth observation analytics for smart decision-making." class="fluid" width="1472" height="840" no-lazy="" style="height: auto;"></picture> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="section-eosda_2025 pt-0 bg-third small-desktop"> <div class="container"> <div class="decoration mb-2 mb-md-5"></div> <div class="eosda-banner_2025 radius-md p-3 pt-4 p-md-4 p-lg-7"> <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-between"> <div class="col-md-3 d-flex justify-content-center mb-5 mb-lg-0"> <img class="lazy entered loaded" data-src="/assets-f/img/35c30da0620aa9.svg" alt="EOS Data Analytics Logo" width="251" height="105" style="height: auto;" src="/assets-f/img/35c30da0620aa9.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"> </div> <div class="col"> <p>EOS Data Analytics is a global provider of satellite data and intelligence that bridges the gap between raw satellite imagery and the business decisions you need to make. </p> <p>While operating the EOS SAT-1 satellite alongside 20+ partner constellations, we focus on what matters on the ground. EOSDA's proprietary AI algorithms transform vast amounts of imagery into clear visualizations and data-to-decision reports, ensuring you get the exact insights rather than raw pixels.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="section-products_2025 bg-third small-desktop"> <div class="container"> <header class="title-section text-center"> <h2>Сore platforms by EOS Data Analytics</h2> </header> <div class="slider-mob-card-products owl-theme-custom"> <div class="card card-product_2025 bg-secondary w-100 shadow-none border-0"> <div class="image"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/398cb87873dbb4.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" srcset="/assets-f/img/398cb87873dbb4.webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/398cb87873dbb4.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp" srcset="/assets-f/img/398cb87873dbb4.webp"><img class="lazy entered loaded" data-src="/assets-f/img/a3117003bd1e4a.png" alt="Sharp satellite imagery and advanced analytical features in LandViewer by EOS Data Analytics offer detailed insights, even in the most remote land plots." width="412" height="206" style="height: auto;" src="/assets-f/img/a3117003bd1e4a.png" data-ll-status="loaded"></picture> <div class="logo bg-secondary"> <img class="lazy entered loaded" data-src="/assets-f/img/e65fa47cf7ac81.svg" alt="logo LandViewer" width="176" height="78" style="height: auto;" src="/assets-f/img/e65fa47cf7ac81.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"> </div> </div> <div class="content p-4 p-lg-6 pt-lg-5 d-flex flex-column h-100"> <div class="mb-auto"> <h3 class="h4">LandViewer</h3> <p class="text-primary">Search, visualize, and analyze satellite imagery directly in your browser.</p> </div> <div class="btns-row mt-5 flex-column"> <a class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'try_now_button', 'eventLabel':'products', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'lv', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Try now</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'products', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'lv', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Learn more</a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="card card-product_2025 bg-secondary w-100 shadow-none border-0"> <div class="image"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/2e623e60b06a19.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" srcset="/assets-f/img/2e623e60b06a19.webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/2e623e60b06a19.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp" srcset="/assets-f/img/2e623e60b06a19.webp"><img class="lazy entered loaded" data-src="/assets-f/img/fb8837cf5f198d.png" alt="Crop Monitoring platform by EOS Data Analytics identifying early signs of crop stress, pest infestations, and nutrient deficiencies across agricultural fields." width="412" height="206" style="height: auto;" src="/assets-f/img/fb8837cf5f198d.png" data-ll-status="loaded"></picture> <div class="logo bg-secondary"> <img class="lazy entered loaded" data-src="/assets-f/img/e89363b5900a50.svg" alt="logo Crop Monitoring" width="196" height="78" style="height: auto;" src="/assets-f/img/e89363b5900a50.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"> </div> </div> <div class="content p-4 p-lg-6 pt-lg-5 d-flex flex-column h-100"> <div class="mb-auto"> <h3 class="h4">Crop Monitoring</h3> <p class="text-primary">Track crop health and field conditions with a precision agriculture tool through the entire growing season.</p> </div> <div class="btns-row mt-5 flex-column"> <a class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'try_now_button', 'eventLabel':'products', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'cm', 'eventContext':''});" href="https://crop-monitoring.eos.com/login" target="_blank">Try now</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'products', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'cm', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Learn more</a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="card card-product_2025 bg-secondary w-100 shadow-none border-0"> <div class="image"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/199fbc3686da98.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" srcset="/assets-f/img/199fbc3686da98.webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/199fbc3686da98.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp" srcset="/assets-f/img/199fbc3686da98.webp"><img class="lazy entered loaded" data-src="/assets-f/img/c03c1c49571777.png" alt="A customized EOSDA RayVision report interface with color-coded data visualizations over a satellite map." width="412" height="206" style="height: auto;" src="/assets-f/img/c03c1c49571777.png" data-ll-status="loaded"></picture> <div class="logo bg-secondary"> <img class="lazy entered loaded" data-src="/assets-f/img/2c465b0540afe3.svg" alt="logo RayVision" width="512" height="166" style="height: auto;" src="/assets-f/img/2c465b0540afe3.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"> </div> </div> <div class="content p-4 p-lg-6 pt-lg-5 d-flex flex-column h-100"> <div class="mb-auto"> <h3 class="h4">EOS RayVision</h3> <p class="text-primary">Get tailored analytical reports that turn complex data into clear, visual stories for any industry.</p> </div> <div class="btns-row mt-5 flex-column"> <button class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'demo_request_button', 'eventLabel':'products', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'custom_solutions', 'eventContext':'Book a demo'});sessionStorage.setItem('#modalEosContactUs', JSON.stringify({ 'modal-autocomplete': { 'subject' : 'Book a demo', 'product' : 'Custom Solutions' }, 'events-form' : {'eventLabel':'products', 'eventPosition' : 'custom_solutions'} }) );" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalEosContactUs">Book a demo</button><a class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'products', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'custom_solutions', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Learn more</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="section-solutions bg-primary small-desktop"> <div class="container"> <header class="title-section text-center"> <h2>Analytical solutions</h2> </header> <div class="vertical-tabs"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-lg-6"> <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="solutionsTab" role="tablist"> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <div class="nav-link active" id="solutions1-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#solutions1" role="tab" aria-controls="solutions1" aria-selected="true"> <h3 class="h4"> <i class="icon lazy entered loaded" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://eos.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/main-page-crop-classification-icon.svg&quot;);" data-bg="/assets-f/img/a91e2c84e896d0.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"></i> Crop classification </h3> <div class="more mt-3"> <p>Identify crop types and field boundaries with high-accuracy ML models by EOS Data Analytics. Get reliable maps to optimize logistics and field management.</p> <div class="image-wrap d-lg-none mt-3"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/6cd04964016bec.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/6cd04964016bec.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp"><img data-src="/assets-f/img/6406bdea162524.png" alt="EOS Data Analytics satellite map showing color-coded crop classification and precisely detected field boundaries." class="fluid radius-md lazy" width="628" height="640" style="height: auto;" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20628%20640'%3E%3C/svg%3E"></picture> </div> <div class="info mt-3 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start"> <a class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'featured_solutions', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'crop_classification', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Explore this solution</a> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <div class="nav-link " id="solutions2-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#solutions2" role="tab" aria-controls="solutions2" aria-selected="true"> <h3 class="h4"> <i class="icon lazy entered loaded" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://eos.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/main-page-yield-prediction-icon.svg&quot;);" data-bg="/assets-f/img/98d95acb8e63a7.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"></i> Yield prediction </h3> <div class="more mt-3"> <p>Forecast crop production levels with confidence. EOS Data Analytics combines biophysical and ML models to deliver regional yield estimates across any season.</p> <div class="image-wrap d-lg-none mt-3"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/6e94dcb6572cf4.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/6e94dcb6572cf4.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp"><img data-src="/assets-f/img/125a7ec93a8d8f.png" alt="A data dashboard displaying predicted crop yields and production forecasts based on EOSDA analysis." class="fluid radius-md lazy" width="628" height="640" style="height: auto;" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20628%20640'%3E%3C/svg%3E"></picture> </div> <div class="info mt-3 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start"> <a class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'featured_solutions', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'yield_prediction', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Explore this solution</a> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <div class="nav-link " id="solutions3-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#solutions3" role="tab" aria-controls="solutions3" aria-selected="true"> <h3 class="h4"> <i class="icon lazy entered loaded" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://eos.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/main-page-infrastructure-monitoring-icon.svg&quot;);" data-bg="/assets-f/img/272b9c8f4ad157.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"></i> Infrastructure monitoring </h3> <div class="more mt-3"> <p>Keep an eye on infrastructure assets. Monitor pipelines, dams, mines, and remote equipment activity for safer and efficent operations.</p> <div class="image-wrap d-lg-none mt-3"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/5fb23c3801d064.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/5fb23c3801d064.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp"><img data-src="/assets-f/img/2f5a5ce00b66ad.png" alt="High-resolution satellite view of industrial infrastructure with change detection markers and asset alerts by EOS Data Analytics." class="fluid radius-md lazy" width="628" height="640" style="height: auto;" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20628%20640'%3E%3C/svg%3E"></picture> </div> <div class="info mt-3 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start"> <a class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'featured_solutions', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'infrastructure_monitoring', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Explore this solution</a> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <div class="nav-link " id="solutions4-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#solutions4" role="tab" aria-controls="solutions4" aria-selected="true"> <h3 class="h4"> <i class="icon lazy entered loaded" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://eos.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/main-page-damage-mapping-icon.svg&quot;);" data-bg="/assets-f/img/521a5748ca523d.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"></i> Damage mapping </h3> <div class="more mt-3"> <p>Speed up recovery and prevent losses with rapid disaster analysis and contamination detection. Perfect for verifying insurance claims and coordinating emergency response.</p> <div class="image-wrap d-lg-none mt-3"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/915eb72ae71831.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/915eb72ae71831.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp"><img data-src="/assets-f/img/9efb173a912682.png" alt="Satellite damage assessment map by EOS Data Analytics shows flooded areas and structural impact following a natural disaster." class="fluid radius-md lazy" width="628" height="640" style="height: auto;" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20628%20640'%3E%3C/svg%3E"></picture> </div> <div class="info mt-3 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start"> <a class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'featured_solutions', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'damage_mapping', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Explore this solution</a> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <div class="nav-link " id="solutions5-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#solutions5" role="tab" aria-controls="solutions5" aria-selected="true"> <h3 class="h4"> <i class="icon lazy entered loaded" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://eos.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/main-page-maritime-surveillance-icon.svg&quot;);" data-bg="/assets-f/img/0fa1129112d034.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"></i> Maritime surveillance </h3> <div class="more mt-3"> <p>Track vessel movement and port activity from space. Get the insights you need for security, compliance, and global logistics.</p> <div class="image-wrap d-lg-none mt-3"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/68b758477fe607.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/68b758477fe607.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp"><img data-src="/assets-f/img/29dd0e20057f07.png" alt="Satellite imagery of shipping lanes and port traffic by EOS Data Analytics, featuring identified vessel tracks and security highlights." class="fluid radius-md lazy" width="628" height="640" style="height: auto;" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20628%20640'%3E%3C/svg%3E"></picture> </div> <div class="info mt-3 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start"> <a class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'featured_solutions', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'maritime_surveillance', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Explore this solution</a> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <div class="nav-link " id="solutions6-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#solutions6" role="tab" aria-controls="solutions6" aria-selected="true"> <h3 class="h4"> <i class="icon lazy entered loaded" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://eos.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/main-page-border-security-icon.svg&quot;);" data-bg="/assets-f/img/0b648aed41e409.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"></i> Border security </h3> <div class="more mt-3"> <p>Secure border zones by identifying new trails, unusual activity, and terrain changes to help patrols prioritize their response.</p> <div class="image-wrap d-lg-none mt-3"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/e7fd12b7a6787d.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/e7fd12b7a6787d.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp"><img data-src="/assets-f/img/3709d9d5df452f.png" alt="EOSDA's satellite surveillance of a border region highlighting newly formed routes and changes in terrain." class="fluid radius-md lazy" width="628" height="640" style="height: auto;" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20628%20640'%3E%3C/svg%3E"></picture> </div> <div class="info mt-3 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start"> <a class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'featured_solutions', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosition':'border_security', 'eventContext':''});" href="#" target="_blank">Explore this solution</a> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="nav-item" role="presentation"> <div class="nav-link " id="solutions7-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#solutions7" role="tab" aria-controls="solutions7" aria-selected="true"> <h3 class="h4"> <i class="icon lazy entered loaded" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://eos.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/main-page-change-detection-icon.svg&quot;);" data-bg="/assets-f/img/195ba69340448a.svg" data-ll-status="loaded"></i> Change detection </h3> <div class="more mt-3"> <p>Spot meaningful shifts on the ground using clear before and after satellite imagery by EOSDA. Receive alerts for new land use changes for faster investigation.</p> <div class="image-wrap d-lg-none mt-3"> <picture><source srcset="/assets-f/img/9dcb3bc3167736.webp" media="(max-width: 768px)" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/assets-f/img/9dcb3bc3167736.webp" media="(max-width: 1024px)" type="image/webp"><img data-src="/assets-f/img/9ff34d00a13f75.png" alt="A split-screen satellite comparison by EOS Data Analytics showing automated change detection between two different dates." class="fluid radius-md lazy" width="628" height="640" style="height: auto;" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20628%20640'%3E%3C/svg%3E"></picture> </div> <div class="info mt-3 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start"> <a class="btn btn-primary1" onclick="dataLayer.push({'event':'EOSCOM', 'eventCategory':'EosComEvents', 'eventAction':'more_info_button', 'eventLabel':'featured_solutions', 'eventContent':'', 'eventPosit